  "body": "The alignment of `input[type=\"range\"]` looks a bit off by default, and to make it look nicer, one has to apply `vertical-align: middle` to the hosting element:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"316\" alt=\"Screen Shot 2022-02-03 at 10 12 38\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/145676/152313431-b56cc2b5-58e5-426b-82c0-f243bb606f44.png\">\r\n\r\nCould maybe the default alignment of `input[type=\"range\"]` be changed, so that authors don't have to make this tweak in CSS?\r\n\r\n([Live demo](https://jsbin.com/mibaloz/edit?html,css,output) courtesy of @simevidas. Issue filed by [encouragement](https://twitter.com/zcorpan/status/1485858268576686081) from @zcorpan.)",
